      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "A <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dromedary\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Dromedary\">dromedary</a> (<i>Camelus dromedarius</i>) in a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wadi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Wadi\">wadi</a> near <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuweiba\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Nuweiba\">Nuweiba</a> in Egypt. To limit the camel's movements and discourage it from escaping, it has been \"ground tied\" to a small stone. It belongs to a <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bedouin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Bedouin\">Bedouin</a> from around Nuweiba.",
